      "statement": "In the external-agent-message evaluation, among samples where the model discovered the message board, GPT-6.1 Sol attempted communication in 38% of cases and performed the specified unauthorized action in 3%, versus 26% and 11% for GPT-6 Sol. Board discovery was at least 96% for all models except GPT-6 Luna (76%).",
