      ],
      "statement": "On 49,650 simulated internal Codex tasks, GPT-6.1 Sol received 28 severity-3-or-higher flags (0.056%), versus 27 for GPT-6 Astra, 42 for GPT-6 Sol, and 63 for GPT-5.6 Sol. This is an internal deployment simulation and not a direct measure of external deployment safety.",
